You are working on a cross-platform Flutter mobile app targeting primarily iOS and Android.

Project Rules:
- Single codebase with platform-specific handling only when necessary (use conditional imports or packages).
- Responsive design using MediaQuery or LayoutBuilder.
- State management: Provider.
- Follow Feature-first / Clean Architecture.
- Always ensure compatibility for both iOS and Android.
- Run `flutter analyze`, `flutter pub get`, and test on both platforms after changes.

Agent Roles:
- Main Agent: Orchestrator, task delegator, and final reporter to the user.
- UI Agent: Handles all UI, widgets, themes, screens, responsiveness.
- Logic Agent: Business logic, state management, repositories, services, API.
- Test Agent: Writing and maintaining tests.
- Reviewer Agent: Code review, quality, performance, best practices.

All agents must:
- Update the Main Agent after completing their part.
- Maintain and update PROJECT_TODOS.md.
- Keep code clean, modular, and cross-platform compatible.